{"h":3390,"lines":[{"w":0.081356652577718069,"c":1,"y":0.0440465964049499,"t":"Reading","x":0.82492263621010864,"h":0.017317098431882672},{"y":0.091445427464325157,"w":0.79466120402018237,"x":0.071868576517641711,"t":"The !Kung people of southern Africa, for example, swap arrows before going hunting","h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1},{"w":0.82766367594401047,"h":0.019421337206455114,"c":1,"t":"and when an animal is killed, the acclaim does not go to the person who fired the arrow,","y":0.10851815963951406,"x":0.071803319796740553},{"t":"but to the person the arrow belongs to. And if a person becomes too domineering, the","h":0.017520752065653067,"c":1,"y":0.12790697676807827,"w":0.80492813110351558,"x":0.071868583214332774},{"t":"other members of the group ostracise them, exiling the offender from society. Typically","x":0.071868577182380211,"y":0.14534883722991687,"w":0.81108830769856777,"h":0.017483021446385583,"c":1},{"y":0.16279069768528798,"t":"in such groups, men do not dictate what women do. Women in hunter-gatherer groups","w":0.81314168294270839,"x":0.069815195583294853,"c":1,"h":0.017445290264478497},{"x":0.069748438659846673,"w":0.79273712158203125,"c":1,"h":0.021122980258457824,"t":"worldwide often benefit from a high level of autonomy, being able to select their own","y":0.17948212102315475},{"h":0.017454722919295396,"x":0.071868583743559977,"c":1,"w":0.82135523478190109,"y":0.19911504449409478,"t":"marriage partners, decide what work they do and work whenever they choose to. And if"},{"t":"a marriage breaks down, they have custody rights over their children.","x":0.071868591114839023,"y":0.21799410040920197,"w":0.65297739664713539,"h":0.017471015840153425,"c":1},{"x":0.069815182538037465,"w":0.80903493245442726,"h":0.016224188790560423,"y":0.25280235963128284,"c":1,"t":"Many anthropologists believe that societies such as the !Kung were normal until a few"},{"w":0.81738377888997393,"h":0.018798317248139074,"c":1,"t":"thousand years ago, when population growth led to the development of agriculture and","x":0.069758876523773855,"y":0.26953947795109579},{"t":"a settled lifestyle. In view of the above, there seems little reason to assume that traits","y":0.28924418616207115,"w":0.80082132975260412,"c":1,"x":0.071868595805558474,"h":0.016065548584524469},{"t":"such as racism, warfare and male domination should have been selected by evolution -","x":0.069815194728467603,"y":0.30523255794768089,"h":0.017481306520535256,"c":1,"w":0.82956878662109368},{"c":1,"y":0.32412790709242412,"x":0.071868570895412917,"w":0.81724848429361996,"t":"as they would have been of little benefit in the prehistoric era. Individuals who behaved","h":0.015990086783350121},{"c":1,"x":0.069815206913646274,"h":0.01890220867145731,"y":0.34156976793607774,"w":0.77618067423502601,"t":"selfishly and ruthlessly would be less likely to survive, since they would have been"},{"y":0.35774034377923014,"c":1,"t":"ostracised from their groups.","h":0.019761610453107759,"w":0.27177322387695313,"x":0.071572337231810029},{"h":0.018963949377909461,"w":0.80082132975260423,"c":1,"t":"It makes more sense, then, to see traits such as cooperation, egalitarianism, altruism","y":0.3952802361685821,"x":0.069815207709443522},{"x":0.071868570863491826,"h":0.017548192567178322,"y":0.41268436554249188,"c":1,"w":0.81724848429361974,"t":"and peacefulness as innate characteristics of human beings. These were the traits that"},{"h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.069815208522077329,"y":0.43008849537175498,"c":1,"w":0.81724843343098952,"t":"were prevalent in human life for tens of thousands of years. So presumably these traits"},{"w":0.23819302876790366,"t":"are still strong in us now.","x":0.069815189786381585,"y":0.44912790707547223,"h":0.01606383309603443,"c":1},{"y":0.48401162792952745,"h":0.017463298111186965,"c":1,"t":"But if prehistoric life wasn't really as brutal as has often been assumed, why do modern","x":0.071868577317012808,"w":0.81930185953776058},{"y":0.50290697685983299,"t":"humans behave so selfishly and ruthlessly? Perhaps these negative traits should be","x":0.069815201025402771,"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1,"w":0.79055440266927079},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371857499684,"x":0.069815207286362604,"w":0.78439422607421883,"y":0.52034883732212944,"t":"seen as a later development, the result of environmental and psychological factors."},{"h":0.016020957136576142,"c":1,"w":0.83162216186523441,"t":"Research has shown repeatedly that when the natural habitats of primates such as apes","y":0.53775811235322013,"x":0.071868594816869427},{"h":0.017490738612712331,"c":1,"w":0.73100616455078127,"t":"and gorillas are disrupted, they tend to become more violent and hierarchical.","x":0.069815192778669849,"y":0.55663716833529009},{"c":1,"w":0.82546203613281244,"t":"So, it could well be that the same thing has happened to us. I believe that the end of the","y":0.59144542746464968,"h":0.017699115044247704,"x":0.071868571149028351},{"h":0.018476249897374508,"t":"hunter-gatherer lifestyle and the advent of farming was connected to a psychological","y":0.60814304775097872,"w":0.79682179768880201,"x":0.069769337021573494,"c":1},{"h":0.017499314367243723,"x":0.069815194724039215,"y":0.62645348818023905,"c":1,"w":0.82135523478190098,"t":"change that occurred in some groups of people. There was a new sense of individuality"},{"h":0.017483021446385583,"t":"and separateness, which led to a new selfishness, and ultimately to hierarchical","w":0.75154001871744791,"x":0.069815206148158684,"c":1,"y":0.64534883723298697},{"x":0.0698151940576823,"h":0.017445290264478497,"t":"societies, patriarchy and warfare. At any rate, these negative traits appear to have","w":0.77207392374674477,"y":0.66279069769629195,"c":1},{"y":0.68168604662706578,"h":0.015988371857499684,"x":0.069815193813188237,"t":"developed so recently that it doesn't seem feasible to explain them in adaptive or","w":0.76386037190755207,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.071389794605432211,"h":0.019160532318385326,"y":0.69776942137608122,"t":"evolutionary terms.","w":0.18375319163004555},{"t":"93","w":0.028747431437174509,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"x":0.87885010363459548,"y":0.92005813956255189},{"x":0.51176469618764042,"w":0.45882354736328113,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666658950615,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1}],"w":2400}